00:21:01.586 --> 00:21:03.310
and every Cloud provider

00:21:03.311 --> 00:21:05.865
that consumes SONiC
and every one of you,

00:21:05.866 --> 00:21:08.940
if you can send SONiC
can pick your software.

00:21:08.941 --> 00:21:11.410
Hit this upgrade is huge for us,

