we want to be able if there's
a bug take care of it,

00:21:13.311 --> 00:21:15.150
if there's a feature we
want take care of it

00:21:15.151 --> 00:21:17.820
without you as
a customer noticing.

00:21:17.821 --> 00:21:21.430
So, we can fix bugs and do fleet

00:21:21.431 --> 00:21:26.640
wide security patches in hours
and new features in days.

00:21:26.641 --> 00:21:29.830
Yeah, we put the pressure
of the entire cloud on

00:21:29.831 --> 00:21:34.180
the software so it's battle
tested. Open Source.

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:38.125
So, it's working out, as I said,

