00:34:53.580 --> 00:34:57.635
It's really an
exciting opportunity

00:34:57.636 --> 00:35:01.405
to rethink the basics
of networking.

00:35:01.406 --> 00:35:07.269
I don't know how to directly,
or somehow chemically,

00:35:07.270 --> 00:35:08.615
or viscerally convince you

00:35:08.616 --> 00:35:11.960
that reliability is
the most cool thing to work on,

00:35:11.961 --> 00:35:13.710
the most important
thing to work on.

00:35:13.711 --> 00:35:15.670
But, if you start to think

00:35:15.671 --> 00:35:21.210
about changing all of
computing to run in the cloud,

00:35:21.211 --> 00:35:23.650
and then just recourse on that,

00:35:23.651 --> 00:35:25.820
and think about,
what does that mean?

00:35:25.980 --> 00:35:29.725
All the startups,
all the already started Apps,

00:35:29.726 --> 00:35:34.170
all the work that you see
pouring in cloud, all them,

00:35:34.171 --> 00:35:36.760
