then you'll see

00:35:36.761 --> 00:35:38.670
that reliability is really

00:35:38.671 --> 00:35:41.015
a hard problem and deep
and takes years of work,

00:35:41.016 --> 00:35:45.955
and we need you to
help us get there.

00:35:45.956 --> 00:35:49.130
All right, I'll wrap it up.

